  "id": "darkness-ablaze-build-battle-box",
  "name": "Darkness Ablaze Build & Battle Box",
  "category": "product_promotion",
  "description": {
    "text": "With prerelease tournaments still on hold during the COVID-19 pandemic, shops in the Prerelease Program sold the boxes from 1 August 2020, before a wider release on 28 August. Each box held four Darkness Ablaze booster packs and a 23-card Evolution pack built around one of four promos with the Darkness Ablaze logo. The packs also held non-holo copies of Tapu Koko, Darkrai and Kangaskhan, which booster packs have only in holofoil, and Sword & Shield's non-holo Professor's Research, first found in that expansion's box.",
